title square screen: Cassette: trim and split (board CassetteTrim): Take 006, a 60 s window, IN and OUT outside as edge chips, two splits with the second selected (SPLIT reads REMOVE)
sizes 720x720
ppmm 1000
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot trim
expect text "REMOVE"
expect text "ZOOM"
expect text "POSITION"
expect text "SET IN"
expect text "SAVE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
